{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb1 <strong>Aquarius \u2013 Flip. Drink. Discover.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThey said the city sang to itself. In wires. In gears. In the deep, drowned rhythm of something that should not move\u2026 and yet does.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aquarius</strong> is a surreal, musical pinball opera\u2014a mechanical voyage through four haunted \u201cwatches\u201d of the day, each one driven by rhythm, myth, and madness. Guided by a groggy sailor and shadowed by an aging Captain in a white admiral\u2019s coat, you\u2019ll unlock stories, capture creatures, and ride the shifting tides of a living, breathing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything pulses to music. Everything is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>What You Discover</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa0 <strong>The Great Carousel</strong><br>Home to four rotating mini-tables that spin like a stage set between acts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798060/extras/3c8a96a533b4709888453e51665a6491.avif?t=1751546997\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf7a <i>The Drunken Sailor</i> \u2013 A tavern of shouting ghosts and bell towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0b <i>Charge the Batteries</i> \u2013 Sparks fly in time with the beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <i>Aquarius Song</i> \u2013 A forbidden melody rewired into steel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc19 <i>The Dog and the Kraken</i> \u2013 A leash snaps. A sea beast answers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfbc <strong>The Music Machine</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798060/extras/3fe7e571d70bda2bafd579f5f48e7a5b.avif?t=1751546997\" /></div><br>Every bumper, target, flipper, and trap is <i>synchronized to the music</i>\u2014mini-levels unfold like acts in a tango performance<br>\ud83c\udfb9 The Captain doesn\u2019t just play\u2014<strong>he conducts the table</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd91 <strong>Dunk exotic animals</strong> using tentacle-shaped arms of the central Carousel<br>\ud83c\udfa1 Collected creatures spin inside the <strong>Ferris Wheel of Specimens</strong><br>\ud83d\udcfb <strong>Morse code recorder</strong> receives capture directives from your divers below<br>\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Imperial Recorder</strong> logs your every discovery in a visual archive of exploration<br>\ud83d\udcfa C<strong>ams</strong> stream the show as it unfolds across the playfield</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca1 Additional Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Side target banks</strong> to unlock secret modes and combo chains<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Dynamic tides</strong> change game physics and visuals in real time<br>\ud83e\udd3f <strong>Multiple diver characters</strong>, each with unique scoring abilities and perks<br>\ud83c\udfa2 <strong>Twin lava\u00a0 ramps</strong> that launch into rhythm-controlled bonus zones<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Hand-drawn comic scenes</strong>, revealed mid-match<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Original dynamic soundtrack</strong> blending steampunk tango, ambient deep-sea echoes, and organ-driven shanties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aquarius</strong> is no longer just a machine\u2014it\u2019s a conductor, a monster, and a stage.<br>It sings. It strikes. It remembers.<br><strong>Are you ready to flip to the rhythm?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798060/extras/36ff931ce27e1ada0e260addc6588b35.avif?t=1751546997\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798060?t=1751546997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798060/186bab83eaf77957d2013b2b55103e4abb7a65aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751546997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798060/0864f35391de5f412b3cd32d738b969fdaa10456/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751546997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798060/0864f35391de5f412b3cd32d738b969fdaa10456/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751546997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb1 <strong>Aquarius \u2013 Flip. Drink. Discover.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThey said the city sang to itself. In wires. In gears. In the deep, drowned rhythm of something that should not move\u2026 and yet does.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aquarius</strong> is a surreal, musical pinball opera\u2014a mechanical voyage through four haunted \u201cwatches\u201d of the day, each one driven by rhythm, myth, and madness. Guided by a groggy sailor and shadowed by an aging Captain in a white admiral\u2019s coat, you\u2019ll unlock stories, capture creatures, and ride the shifting tides of a living, breathing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything pulses to music. Everything is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>What You Discover</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa0 <strong>The Great Carousel</strong><br>Home to four rotating mini-tables that spin like a stage set between acts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht